{
  "_doc": "Manifest consumed ONLY by scripts/create-project.sh, at project creation time. Unlike config-links.json (symlink, resynced on every link-config.mjs run, real-file override skips it), this manifest COPIES each source file once into a brand-new project and substitutes {{SITE_NAME}}, {{ENTITY_NAME}}, {{CONTACT_EMAIL}} and {{PROJECT_NAME}} with the values collected by the create-project.sh prompts. The resulting files are plain, project-owned files from that point on — no tool ever re-copies or re-links them after creation, so they are safe to customize freely (Header, Footer, PageLayout, Router, Title, landing page, legal placeholder pages, minimal front/back bootstrap). Paths are relative to this submodule root (source) and to the new project root (target).",
  "front": {
    "front/index.html": "front/index.html",
    "front/vite.config.ts": "front/vite.config.ts",
    "front/src/components/Title.tsx": "front/src/components/Title.tsx",
